					<VULN_ATTRIBUTE>Check_Content</VULN_ATTRIBUTE>
					<ATTRIBUTE_DATA>Run Firefox. Click the ellipsis button &gt;&gt; Help &gt;&gt; About Firefox, and view the version number.

If the Firefox version is not a supported version, this is a finding.</ATTRIBUTE_DATA>
				</STIG_DATA>
